  "title": "India's Defence Modernization and Javelin Missile Acquisition",
  "summary": "India has signed a deal with the U.S. to procure Javelin anti-tank guided missile systems for the Indian Army, marking a significant step in India's modernization efforts and enhancing its combat capabilities. The deal is part of India's broader focus on strengthening its military infrastructure and fostering international partnerships.",
  "facts": [
