      "title": "India buys US Javelin anti-tank missiles for Army in Rs 292-crore deal",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/external-affairs-defence-security/news/india-us-javelin-anti-tank-missile-deal-indian-army-126082800773_1.html",
      "description": "A medium-range, man-portable, shoulder-launched missile, the Javelin is designed to engage tanks, other armoured systems and bunkers",
      "source_name": "Business Standard Latest",
      "published": "2026-08-28T10:05:18"
    },
    {
      "title": "India to procure Javelin anti-tank guided missile systems from US: Gor",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/external-affairs-defence-security/news/india-to-procure-javelin-anti-tank-guided-missile-systems-from-us-gor-126082800621_1.html",
      "description": "India has sealed a deal with the US to procure Javelin anti-tank guided missile systems to bolster the Indian Army's combat prowess.\nUS Ambassador Sergio Gor said the agreement reflects a bilateral defence partnership that is growing \"deeper, more capable, and more consequential.\"\nIt is not immediately known the number of Javelin anti-tank guided missile systems India is procuring or the overall cost of the procurement.\nThe United States welcomes the Indian Army's signing of a Letter of Offer and Acceptance (LOA) for the purchase of the Javelin anti-tank guided missile system through the US Foreign Military Sales process, an American readout said.\nIt said the \"milestone\" reflects the enduring partnership between the US and Indian armed forces and opens the door for future collaboration between the US and Indian defence industries.\n\"The Javelin agreement demonstrates the depth of US support for the Indian Army and creates new opportunities for our defence industries to work togethe",
      "source_name": "Business Standard Latest",
      "published": "2026-08-28T09:39:55"
    }
  ]
